SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Wild Area 2026: Sendai • Tohoku
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-sendai-japan/
DESCRIPTION:Pokemon GO Wild Area 2026: Sendai • Tohoku takes place on Nov
 ember 6\, 7\, or 8\, 2026\, from 10:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. JST in Sendai and
  Miyagi Prefecture. The event features Steel- and Dragon-type Pokemon\, th
 e debuts of Gigantamax Duraludon\, Dynamax Dialga\, and Dynamax Palkia\, a
 nd ticket-exclusive gameplay. Participants can collect GO Safari Balls\, b
 attle in raids and Max Battles\, and complete event-themed Special and Tim
 ed Research.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-send
 ai-japan/
END:VEVENT
