DTEND:20261110T223000Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon Night Out 2026 - London
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-night-out-london-2026/
DESCRIPTION:Attend Pokémon Night Out 2026 in London at the O2 Arena on Nov
 ember 10\, 2026\, from 6:00 p.m. to 10:30 p.m. GMT for special gameplay. E
 njoy increased wild spawns\, raid encounters with Pikachu and Gengar that 
 feature a London Location Background\, and Timed Research rewarding event-
 themed Pokémon and a baseball jersey avatar item.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com
 /events/pokemon-night-out-london-2026/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
