DTSTAMP:20261107T060955Z
DTSTART:20261109T160000Z
DTEND:20261114T020000Z
SUMMARY:Into the Wild
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/into-the-wild-2026/
DESCRIPTION:During the Into the Wild event from November 9 to November 15\,
  2026\, Regidrago and Dynamax Meltan make their Dynamax debuts. Trainers c
 an participate in five-star raids featuring Crowned Sword Zacian and Crown
 ed Shield Zamazenta\, complete GO Pass tasks\, and enjoy boosted encounter
 s with Shiny Meltan via the Mystery Box.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com/events/in
 to-the-wild-2026/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
