DTSTART:20261114T160000Z
DTEND:20261116T000000Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Wild Area 2026: Global
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-global/
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon GO Wild Area 2026: Global takes place worldwide on Nov
 ember 14 and 15\, 2026\, from 10:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. local time each day.
  The event features Steel- and Dragon-type Pokémon\, the debuts of Gigant
 amax Duraludon\, Dynamax Dialga\, and Dynamax Palkia\, and GO Safari Balls
  to help catch mighty Pokémon. Players can also encounter costumed Macham
 p in three-star raids and enjoy rotating habitat hours.\n\nhttps://leekduc
 k.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-global/
END:VEVENT
