 19\, 2026. Explore by starlight from 5:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time dai
 ly for an increased chance to encounter Minior in its Meteor Form in the w
 ild. Players receive 1\,000 Stardust for catching Minior.\n\nhttps://leekd
 uck.com/events/minior-showers-leonids-2026/
