UID:november-communityday2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261107T060955Z
DTSTART:20261121T200000Z
DTEND:20261121T230000Z
SUMMARY:Pawniard Community Day
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/november-communityday2026/
DESCRIPTION:Pawniard Community Day takes place on Saturday\, November 21\, 
 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time. Pawniard will appear more f
 requently in the wild with increased chances of being Shiny or having a Sp
 ecial Background. Evolve Bisharp during the event or up to four hours afte
 rwards to get a Kingambit that knows the Charged Attack Kowtow Cleave.\n\n
 https://leekduck.com/events/november-communityday2026/
END:VEVENT
