DTEND:20261124T020000Z
SUMMARY:Dynamax Trails
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/dynamax-trails-2026/
DESCRIPTION:Dynamax Trails runs from November 16 to November 23\, 2026\, fe
 aturing returning Dynamax Pokémon in Max Battles and surging Max Particle
 s. Eternamax Eternatus takes over Power Spots on November 21\, awarding ca
 ndy and candy XL upon defeat. Additionally\, Grookey\, Scorbunny\, and Sob
 ble are featured in Spotlight Hour on November 19 with a 2x Catch Candy bo
 nus.\n\nhttps://leekduck.com/events/dynamax-trails-2026/
END:VEVENT
